[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/comments/445174894","html_url":"https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/issues/1119#issuecomment-445174894","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1119","id":445174894,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ0NTE3NDg5NA==","user":{"login":"weirdan","id":57403,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NDAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57403?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan","html_url":"https://github.com/weirdan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-12-07T09:33:04Z","updated_at":"2018-12-07T09:33:04Z","body":"> so I'm thinking the problem here might be in retaining the intersection type within the typed closure `callable(State):(T&Foo)` and that Psalm may have just internalised this as `callable(State):T`\r\n\r\nIndeed: https://getpsalm.org/r/9cdd0d37b3\r\n```\r\nERROR: InvalidArgument - 40:12 - Argument 1 of type expects void, callable(State):T provided\r\n```","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/comments/445174894/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"weirdan","id":57403,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NDAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57403?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan","html_url":"https://github.com/weirdan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/comments/445226003","html_url":"https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/issues/1119#issuecomment-445226003","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1119","id":445226003,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ0NTIyNjAwMw==","user":{"login":"aidantwoods","id":3288888,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg4ODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3288888?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods","html_url":"https://github.com/aidantwoods","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-12-07T13:01:16Z","updated_at":"2018-12-07T13:01:16Z","body":"Good call on defining that `type` function to get Psalm to print the type in the error message—didn't think of doing that.\r\n\r\nInterestingly if `AlmostFooMap` doesn't implement `AlmostFoo` then Psalm reports no issues (looks like the intersection type is lost from both the closure return and the `makeFoo` return in this case, and Psalm just sees `T` for both—hence no issues), so looks like this issue isn't just restricted to closure returns.\r\n\r\n\"No issues\": https://getpsalm.org/r/f6e0d696cb\r\n\r\nSame code, but printing the type of closure reveals it is different to both return types (should be `callable(State):(T&Foo)`): https://getpsalm.org/r/56954f1dfc\r\n```\r\nERROR: InvalidArgument - 40:14 - Argument 1 of type expects void, callable(State):T provided\r\n```\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/comments/445226003/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"aidantwoods","id":3288888,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg4ODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3288888?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods","html_url":"https://github.com/aidantwoods","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users